      "writtenOn": "2018-10-11T21:42:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems weird to have an instance of a class as a member of class.  Could these be moved into the enclosing namespace, or perhaps put in a Type namespace inside of that?",
      "revId": "bd5bebfe30867d79fa6e415739bbf4e9b24d4c2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
