        "id": 1335232
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-15T22:15:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about making these `static const TypeDescriptor Int();` instead? That way we\u0027d have naming consistency between Int() and FromClass(), or whatever the class one gets called.",
      "parentUuid": "8dc5b70e_3eec537d",
      "revId": "bd5bebfe30867d79fa6e415739bbf4e9b24d4c2d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
